/**
 * The design tokens of TorbScript as CSS custom properties: a copy of `brand/tokens.css`, the file docs/design/BRAND.md
 * describes, carried by the compiler so that the reference `torb doc` writes for any package has the brand without a
 * file of the repository beside it. A test of `compiler/tests/site.test.trb` holds it equal to `brand/tokens.css`: a
 * change of the tokens is made there, by the generator BRAND.md names, and copied here.
 *
 * # Related
 *
 * - `baseStylesheet` of `site-style.trb` - the stylesheet that uses them by their roles.
 */

/** Every token of `brand/tokens.css`, the light theme, the dark theme and the reduced motion, byte for byte. */
public const brandTokens = raw"""
  /* TorbScript design tokens. Generated from the same data as brand/tokens.json; docs/design/BRAND.md. */
  /* Themes: light by default, dark by prefers-color-scheme, and data-theme="light" or "dark" on <html> wins. */

  :root {
    --torb-red-50: #FFF2F2;
    --torb-red-100: #FFE3E2;
